\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Guess Who?<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_161051.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5582\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5582\" class=\"wp-image-5582\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_161051.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_161051-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_161051-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_161051-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_161051-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_161051-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Dillon with ShadePro fixing our patio awning<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_165612.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5583\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5583\" class=\"wp-image-5583\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_165612.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_165612-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_165612-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_165612-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_165612-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190321_165612-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Ham Radio operator and avid RV&#8217;er<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183355.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5584\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5584\" class=\"wp-image-5584\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183355.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183355-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183355-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183355-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183355-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183355-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Sunset on the grounds<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183444.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5585\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5585\" class=\"wp-image-5585\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183444.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183444-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183444-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183444-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183444-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/20190317183444-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Quick look over the polo field parking area<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s a couple videos of the evening entertainment.  This evening&#8217;s video features  &#8220;The American Rogues&#8221; (Sorry the audio is not nearly as impressive as it was at the live presentation).  You could feel the drums beating and the rafters shaking.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"720\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1280 \/ 720;\" width=\"1280\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/AmericanRogues.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>The American Rogues<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s a video of the &#8220;Redhead Express&#8221; &#8211; and 5 of these 6 band members are siblings!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"720\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1280 \/ 720;\" width=\"1280\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/RedHeadExpress.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>The Redhead Express<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for coming along. We are blessed to be able to live the full-time RV lifestyle and we hope you enjoy riding along with us on our adventures.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>So long for now!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>As members of the Escapees RV Club, Kathy and I attended our 2nd &#8220;Escapade&#8221; this past week. The first one we attended was in Essex Junction (Burlington area), Vermont back in summer of 2016. This year&#8217;s Escapade was in Tucson at the Pima County Fairgrounds. The annual Escapade is held in different locations around the &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/03\/23\/great-time-at-escapade-19\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Great Time at Escapade &#8217;19<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"